        "description": "Optional: the encryption key of the device can be read from the Tuya cloud instead of being entered by hand. Almost all devices only need this once, during setup.\n\nRefer to the documentation of the Tuya integration to retrieve the cloud credentials https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/tuya/\n\nEnter your Tuya credentials."
