        "description": "Enter the credentials of the device at {address}. They are read from the device once and kept in Home Assistant, so no Tuya account and no Bluetooth gateway are used afterwards.\n\nThe UUID and product ID are filled in from what the device broadcasts. The device ID and local key cannot be broadcast and have to be supplied: see the integration documentation for ways to read them out.\n\nUUID is 16 characters, device ID is 22 characters, local key is 16 characters.",
